  "text": [
    "Boat anglers targeting salmon had decent fishing.",
    "Anglers were catching mostly coho salmon, with few Chinook salmon and steelhead as well.",
    "The best water seemed to be from 65 to 90 feet deep.",
    "There were a few boats fishing very deep also.",
    "Pier fishing was on the slow side.",
    "When the weather allowed, anglers caught a few steelhead on shrimp.",
    "Lots of drum and catfish were being caught on nightcrawlers and alewife."
  ],
